\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces (a) Plans with the correct visit order out of three runs, against chain depth, at three context settings (points are offset horizontally for legibility). (b) Projected tokens per planning call against depth, measured to depth 30, with the 1024 and 2048 limits marked.}}{40}{figure.caption.48}%
